        "verse": 4
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "He did that which was right in the LORD’s eyes, according to all that his father Amaziah had done.",
      "ko": "웃시야가 그 부친 아마샤의 모든 행위대로 여호와 보시기에 정직히 행하며",
      "source_text_hash": "bc25ea7363ddc6b972ae521a5af665bd16841ed5e5bdf61f7b97e8a3ed796035",
      "translation_text_hash": "f2cee63ed4df477734aaa4b915ea81c07fe93cc8899f7e8d9ad763d3c838ff82",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "웃시야가 그 부친 아마샤의 모든 행위대로 여호와 보시기에 정직히 행하며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f2cee63ed4df477734aaa4b915ea81c07fe93cc8899f7e8d9ad763d3c838ff82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:2CH:26:5",
      "sequence": 11738,
      "chapter_label": "2CH 26",
      "verse_label": "5",
      "locator": {
        "book": "2CH",
