      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 16
        }
      ],
      "en": "But when he was strong, his heart was lifted up, so that he did corruptly and he trespassed against the LORD his God, for he went into the LORD’s temple to burn incense on the altar of incense.",
      "ko": "저가 강성하여지매 그 마음이 교만하여 악을 행하여 그 하나님 여호와께 범죄하되 곧 여호와의 전에 들어가서 향단에 분향하려 한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "11036472545a6a5dc43f9396e4d68831d7e7732b88dfa15ff94ff0bb9255562a",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f268400577c4b7be1bc6685245333d496894e43d3258c6298e49480e3476ff9",
