      ],
      "en": "Azariah the priest went in after him, and with him eighty priests of the LORD, who were valiant men.",
      "ko": "제사장 아사랴가 여호와의 제사장 용맹한 자 팔십인을 데리고 그 뒤를 따라 들어가서",
      "source_text_hash": "ac848402a0023ce9d7f3f12e88e95321c45dd73443091c560cd1d8e3832ab6f7",
      "translation_text_hash": "a85eb8cafa2321691b6ca57d84644525a32602617d553b4adaf822b65745ab1f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
