        "verse": 20
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CH",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "Azariah the chief priest and all the priests looked at him, and behold, he was leprous in his forehead; and they thrust him out quickly from there. Indeed, he himself also hurried to go out, because the LORD had struck him.",
      "ko": "대제사장 아사랴와 모든 제사장이 왕의 이마에 문둥병이 발하였음을 보고 전에서 급히 쫓아내고 여호와께서 치시므로 왕도 속히 나가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "96313f3e9ada814189a52683fea8855a90e311e222ba46bb706e848d7f4a98c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "2f6fedbdd47469528a6eec5a68459dcae1005b354a57daa97c5d0c63a32bcdce",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
